certificate:
  number: R76/2006-GB1-12.10
  page_total: 3
  date_issued: '2012-10-02'
certified_type:
  category: Indicator
  type_designations:
  - AFS
  - AFM
  - ABM
  - ATM
  - APS
  - VFS
  - VFM
  - VBM
  - VTM
  - VPS
  description: >-
    Family of instruments using A-Series and V-Series digital indicators connected to a weighing platform
    forming a Class III or IIII, mains or battery-powered, self-indicating, single interval or dual interval/range,
    non-automatic weighing instrument; may be used for direct sales to the public. Devices: initial and
    semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing, determination
    of stability of equilibrium, zero indicator, net indicator, memory and totalisation, printing. Load
    cells must have an OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity; load cells marked NH are allowed only if humidity
    testing to R76 was conducted on them. Legally relevant parameters protected by a jumper on the main
    board; enclosures and load cell connection sealed using a wire-and-seal method.
